"""ROOT-only local construction proposal. Author never runs this module.

Builds a new qualification packet only after actual local16 and independent62
review. No submit, transfer, inference, source test, compiler or remote effect.
Allocated wrapper alone may run274 neutral cases and two official probes.
"""
